WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.914 --> 00:00:06.149
WITH THAT IN MIND THE QUESTIONS,

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:08.451
DR. HARRIS HAS THE QUESTION.

00:00:08.452 --> 00:00:10.487
&gt;&gt; SECRETARY CASTRO, DO YOU

00:00:10.488 --> 00:00:11.988
DETERMINE THE NUMBER OF PEOPLE

00:00:11.989 --> 00:00:14.190
POURING INTO OUR COUNTRY TO BE A

00:00:14.191 --> 00:00:15.525
NATIONAL CRISIS?

00:00:15.526 --> 00:00:17.427
AND WHAT IS YOUR SOLUTION?

00:00:17.428 --> 00:00:18.261
&gt;&gt; Julian: THANK YOU VERY MUCH

00:00:18.262 --> 00:00:19.629
FOR THE QUESTION.

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:22.332
I BELIEVE WE HAVE A CRISIS OF

00:00:22.333 --> 00:00:22.732
LEADERSHIP.

00:00:22.733 --> 00:00:24.467
IF YOU THINK ABOUT IT FOR A

00:00:24.468 --> 00:00:25.869
SECOND, WHEN HE CAME INTO

00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:28.972
OFFICE, DONALD TRUMP SAID THAT

00:00:28.973 --> 00:00:31.241
HE WAS GOING TO SOLVE THIS AS HE

00:00:31.242 --> 00:00:34.010
PUT IT THIS IMMIGRATION PROBLEM.

00:00:34.011 --> 00:00:35.144
AND HE HAS COMPLETELY FAILED.

00:00:35.145 --> 00:00:37.213
LAST MONTH, THERE WERE 140,000

00:00:37.214 --> 00:00:39.849
PEOPLE THAT CAME TO THE SOUTHERN

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:40.183
BORDER.

00:00:40.184 --> 00:00:42.752
AND IN OUR NAME, LITTLE CHILDREN

00:00:42.753 --> 00:00:43.720
HAVE BEEN SEPARATED FROM THEIR

00:00:43.721 --> 00:00:44.053
MOTHERS.

00:00:44.054 --> 00:00:49.492
PEOPLE RIGHT NOW, ABOUT 100

00:00:49.493 --> 00:00:55.698
PEOPLE ARE IN THE 100-DEGREE

00:00:55.699 --> 00:00:56.399
HEAT OF EL PASO, TEXAS, BEING

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:58.835
FENCED IN AND KEPT LIKE ANIMALS

00:00:58.836 --> 00:01:00.436
TOGETHER WITHOUT A SHOWER OR TO

00:01:00.437 --> 00:01:01.871
CHANGE CLOTHES FOR A WHOLE

00:01:01.872 --> 00:01:02.539
MONTH.

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:03.973
THAT IS A FAILURE THAT THIS

00:01:03.974 --> 00:01:06.442
PRESIDENT HAS BEEN ON THE ISSUE

00:01:06.443 --> 00:01:08.044
OF IMMIGRATION.

00:01:08.045 --> 00:01:13.049
SO I SAY THAT WE HAVE TRIED THIS

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:13.816
CRUELTY AND HIS MISTAKES.

00:01:13.817 --> 00:01:14.984
THERE IS A BETTER WAY TO DO

00:01:14.985 --> 00:01:15.852
THIS.

00:01:15.853 --> 00:01:18.187
AND A COUPLE OF MONTHS AGO, I

00:01:18.188 --> 00:01:19.689
RELEASE MY PEOPLE FIRST

00:01:19.690 --> 00:01:21.858
IMMIGRATION PLAN THAT SAYS,

00:01:21.859 --> 00:01:24.060
NUMBER ONE, THAT WE NEED TO

00:01:24.061 --> 00:01:26.629
TREAT PEOPLE WITH COMPASSION AND

00:01:26.630 --> 00:01:28.064
WITH COMMON SENSE INSTEAD OF

00:01:28.065 --> 00:01:28.398
CRUELTY.

00:01:28.399 --> 00:01:31.301
THAT WE NEED TO -- [APPLAUSE]

00:01:31.302 --> 00:01:36.973
-- WE NEED TO PUT THE

00:01:36.974 --> 00:01:38.207
UNDOCUMENTED IMMIGRANTS WHO ARE

00:01:38.208 --> 00:01:39.842
IN THE UNITED STATES AS LONG AS

00:01:39.843 --> 00:01:41.277
SOMEBODY HASN'T COMMITTED A

00:01:41.278 --> 00:01:44.047
SERIOUS CRIME ON A PATHWAY TO

00:01:44.048 --> 00:01:44.847
CITIZENSHIP INCLUDING AIR

00:01:44.848 --> 00:01:46.249
DREAMERS.

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:48.117
AND WE NEED TO INVEST IN

00:01:48.118 --> 00:01:49.352
IMMIGRATION JUDICIARY IF THAT IS

00:01:49.353 --> 00:01:50.019
INDEPENDENT AND HAS ENOUGH

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:51.988
JUDGES AND SUPPORT STAFF TO

00:01:51.989 --> 00:01:53.089
ACTUALLY GO THROUGH ALL OF THE

00:01:53.090 --> 00:01:54.290
CLAIMS FOR ASYLUM.

00:01:54.291 --> 00:01:56.092
SO THAT PEOPLE ARE NOT WAITING

00:01:56.093 --> 00:01:58.127
IN LIMBO YEARS UPON YEARS.

00:01:58.128 --> 00:01:59.696
PEOPLE THAT ARE OUT THERE IN THE

00:01:59.697 --> 00:02:00.897
COUNTRY ARE JUST WAITING.

00:02:00.898 --> 00:02:03.967
WE CAN DO A BETTER JOB THAN

00:02:03.968 --> 00:02:04.267
THAT.

00:02:04.268 --> 00:02:05.568
AND MAYBE MOST IMPORTANTLY, WE

00:02:05.569 --> 00:02:07.236
ACTUALLY NEED TO GET TO THE ROOT

00:02:07.237 --> 00:02:08.538
CAUSE OF THIS ISSUE.

00:02:08.539 --> 00:02:11.074
AND THE ROOT CAUSE OF THIS ISSUE

00:02:11.075 --> 00:02:15.712
IS THAT IN PLACES LIKE HONDURAS,

00:02:15.713 --> 00:02:16.412
GUATEMALA, EL SALVADOR, PEOPLE

00:02:16.413 --> 00:02:17.447
CANNOT FIND SAFETY OR

00:02:17.448 --> 00:02:18.615
OPPORTUNITY THEY ARE.

00:02:18.616 --> 00:02:20.550
IN THEIR HOME COUNTRY.

00:02:20.551 --> 00:02:22.819
AND SO THAT IS WHY A MOTHER

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:24.487
WOULD BRING HER 6-MONTH-OLD

00:02:24.488 --> 00:02:25.722
INFANT MORE THAN A THOUSAND

00:02:25.723 --> 00:02:27.223
MILES ON A DANGEROUS JOURNEY TO

00:02:27.224 --> 00:02:29.292
THE SOUTHERN BORDER OF THE

00:02:29.293 --> 00:02:30.927
UNITED STATES WITHOUT ANY

00:02:30.928 --> 00:02:31.561
GUARANTEE OF GETTING INTO.

00:02:31.562 --> 00:02:32.295
BECAUSE THEY ARE SO DESPERATE.

00:02:32.296 --> 00:02:34.230
IT IS SO DANGEROUS.

00:02:34.231 --> 00:02:36.065
SO I CALLED FOR THE EQUIVALENT

00:02:36.066 --> 00:02:38.635
OF 20 -- 21ST CENTURY MARSHALL

00:02:38.636 --> 00:02:41.137
PLAN BASED ON MUTUAL RESPECT AND

00:02:41.138 --> 00:02:42.705
WORKING TOGETHER WITH THESE

00:02:42.706 --> 00:02:44.040
COUNTRIES AND MEXICO SO THAT

00:02:44.041 --> 00:02:47.310
PEOPLE CAN FIND THAT SAFETY AND

00:02:47.311 --> 00:02:48.811
OPPORTUNITY THERE AND 140,000

00:02:48.812 --> 00:02:49.545
PEOPLE DON'T HAVE TO COME TO THE

00:02:49.546 --> 00:02:51.247
SOUTHERN BORDER TO TRY TO FIND

00:02:51.248 --> 00:02:52.048
IT HERE.

00:02:52.049 --> 00:02:54.550
I BELIEVE THAT IS A SMARTER,

00:02:54.551 --> 00:02:55.818
MORE EFFECTIVE AND MORE HUMANE

00:02:55.819 --> 00:02:56.853
WAY TO APPROACH IMMIGRATION BAN

00:02:56.854 --> 00:02:58.921
THE WAY WE HAVE DONE IT.

00:02:58.922 --> 00:03:01.157
AND LET ME FINISH THIS ANSWER BY

00:03:01.158 --> 00:03:02.659
STATING, SOME PEOPLE ASK ME, WHY

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:05.361
IN THE WORLD WAS THIS THE FIRST

00:03:05.362 --> 00:03:07.730
POLICY PROPOSAL THAT YOU MADE?

00:03:07.731 --> 00:03:09.198
THIS IS AN ISSUE THAT IS

00:03:09.199 --> 00:03:09.799
PERSONAL TO ME.

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:12.035
I GREW UP WITH A GRANDMOTHER WHO

00:03:12.036 --> 00:03:12.802
CAME OVER HERE FROM THE

00:03:12.803 --> 00:03:14.771
UNITED STATES WHEN SHE WAS SEVEN

00:03:14.772 --> 00:03:15.905
YEARS OLD TO MEXICO WITH HER

00:03:15.906 --> 00:03:17.173
LITTLE SISTER.

00:03:17.174 --> 00:03:19.942
AND THEY CAME BECAUSE THEIR

00:03:19.943 --> 00:03:20.443
PARENTS HAD DIED.

00:03:20.444 --> 00:03:22.812
AND SHE ENDED UP ON THE WEST

00:03:22.813 --> 00:03:23.379
SIDE OF SAN ANTONIO.

00:03:23.380 --> 00:03:24.414
SHE RAISED MY MOM AS A SINGLE

00:03:24.415 --> 00:03:25.648
PARENT.

00:03:25.649 --> 00:03:27.183
SHE WAS BASICALLY LIKE A SECOND

00:03:27.184 --> 00:03:27.884
MOTHER TO ME.

00:03:27.885 --> 00:03:29.218
SHE CAME HERE LIKE A LOT OF

00:03:29.219 --> 00:03:31.988
PARENTS AND GRANDPARENTS DID OR

00:03:31.989 --> 00:03:33.489
MAYBE SOME OF YOU HAVE WITH

00:03:33.490 --> 00:03:35.091
HARDLY ANYTHING.

00:03:35.092 --> 00:03:36.459
AND THIS COUNTRY PROVIDED HER

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:38.695
THE OPPORTUNITY TO WORK HARD, TO

00:03:38.696 --> 00:03:40.196
PROVIDE FOR HER DAUGHTER, TO SEE

00:03:40.197 --> 00:03:41.597
HER DOCTOR TO BE THE FIRST TO

00:03:41.598 --> 00:03:42.799
GRADUATE FROM HIGH SCHOOL AND

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:45.234
THEN GO ON TO COLLEGE.

00:03:45.235 --> 00:03:47.970
AND THEN AFTER SHE GOT TO THE

00:03:47.971 --> 00:03:49.839
UNITED STATES, ONE OF HER

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:51.007
GRANDSONS, MY TWIN BROTHER IS

00:03:51.008 --> 00:03:53.077
THE UNITED STATES CONGRESSMAN

